abstract: >-
  Computational release 4 accompanying manuscript version 5. Five verification
  suites cover exact boundary responses, constitutive algebra, a nonlinear
  thin-slab reduction, a matched-gradient discriminator, and conditional
  empirical-reach calculations. The five program files retain the bytes of
  the immutable source commit 950f4a59f7b9f0dd8425ffb4fa37e429c3c0b4a5.
  The 276 checks are finite computational consistency tests, not empirical
  confirmation or independent quantum-loop calculations.
